{"ref":"BDB, יוֹאָב","hw":"יוֹאָב","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹאָב</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>is father;</em> cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֲבִיָּ֫הוּ\" href=\"/BDB,_אֲבִיָּ֫הוּ\", dir=\"rtl\">אֲבִיָּהוּ</a>, <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֱלִיאָב\" href=\"/BDB,_אֱלִיאָב\", dir=\"rtl\">אֱלִיאָב</a>, <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֲבִיאֵל\" href=\"/BDB,_אֲבִיאֵל\", dir=\"rtl\">אֲבִיאֵל</a> & reff.<strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  David’s sister’s son & captain of his host (𝔊 Ἰωαβ) <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 26:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.26.6\">1 S 26:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:13\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.13\">2 S 2:13</a> + 100 times 2 S (also <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:6\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.6\">2 S 20:6</a> for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבִישַׁי</span> cf. 𝔖 We Dr); <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:7\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.7\">1 K 1:7</a> + 14 times 1 K.; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.16\">1 Ch 2:16</a> + 22 times 1 Ch; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 60:2\" href=\"/Psalms.60.2\">ψ 60:2</a>.<br>†<strong>2.</strong>  a descendant of Judah <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:14\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.14\">1 Ch 4:14</a> (but 𝔊B 𝔊L Ἰωβαβ).<br>†<strong>3.</strong>  a familyname after the exile <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:6\" href=\"/Ezra.2.6\">Ezr 2:6</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:11\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.11\">Ne 7:11</a> (𝔊 Ἰωβαβ, Ἰωαβ) <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:9\" href=\"/Ezra.8.9\">Ezr 8:9</a> (𝔊 Ἰωαβ).","next":"BDB, יוֹאָח","prev":"BDB, יְהוֹשָׁפָט"}